WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.584
(clinking on glass)

00:00:02.878 --> 00:00:04.630
- You hired a nanny for a doll?

00:00:11.887 --> 00:00:13.347
- I think you're starting to
tell yourself

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.098
that doll... is real.

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:19.186
- Why us?

00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:20.562
(drumming)

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:24.816
- I knew I'd be happy here.

